{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Status\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The local MVP is implemented in Lua 5.4 ReaScript with ReaImGui. It includes:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Source Project and Master Project initialization;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab multi-track Reference publication with registered video Items, Markers, Regions, an optional Reference Start Marker, timeline mirroring, and explicit review;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Delivery Track registration, complete Publish Review, immutable WAV revisions, and atomic manifests;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Master-side Delivery Subscription, Lane Mapping, first import, complete snapshot synchronization, and move-to-local confirmation;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab NAS Publish locking, explicit Unlock Publishing, and interrupted-commit recovery.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The current scope assumes new projects initialized through ReaProjectLink and does not infer Links or Lane Bindings for existing unregistered Items.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Runtime requirements are REAPER 7.74 or newer and a ReaImGui 0.9-compatible release or newer.\par}
}
